@host = http://localhost:8080

### Simple boolean question (duplicate-charge refund eligibility)
POST {{host}}/v1/systemone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "jev-latest",
  "state": "The customer found a duplicate charge for order #4821 on their credit card. The duplicate charge is 180 days old and they request a full refund of the duplicate.",
  "questions": {
    "refund_eligible": {
      "type": "noul",
      "instructions": "The customer is eligible for a full refund under the store policy."
    }
  }
}

### Boolean + routing + urgency (item damaged in transit)
POST {{host}}/v1/systemone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "jev-latest",
  "state": "Order #7710 arrived with a smashed box and a cracked vase inside. Delivery was 3 days ago and the customer asks what to do next.",
  "questions": {
    "refund_eligible": {
      "type": "noul",
      "instructions": "The customer is eligible for a full refund under the store policy."
    },
    "responsible_department": {
      "type": "choice",
      "instructions": "Which department should handle this case?",
      "criteria": {
        "billing": "Double charges and payment errors",
        "logistics": "Damaged, lost, or late shipments",
        "product_support": "Defective-item troubleshooting, replacements, and setup help"
      }
    },
    "urgency": {
      "type": "score",
      "instructions": "How urgent is this case?",
      "criteria": ["Routine", "Urgent", "Emergency"]
    }
  }
}

### Complex questions anchored on memory (medical-use air purifier)
# Requires the server started with --context-path resources/memory.md
POST {{host}}/v1/systemone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "jev-latest",
  "state": "The customer received a medical-grade air purifier they depend on daily for a respiratory condition. It arrived 5 days ago with a cracked casing, does not power on, and troubleshooting by phone failed. They request a full refund of 1200 dollars and a working unit as fast as possible.",
  "questions": {
    "refund_eligible": {
      "type": "noul",
      "instructions": "The customer is eligible for a full refund under the store policy."
    },
    "responsible_department": {
      "type": "choice",
      "instructions": "Which department should handle this case?",
      "criteria": {
        "billing": "Double charges and payment errors",
        "logistics": "Damaged, lost, or late shipments",
        "product_support": "Defective-item troubleshooting, replacements, and setup help"
      }
    },
    "urgency": {
      "type": "score",
      "instructions": "How urgent is this case?",
      "criteria": ["Routine", "Urgent", "Emergency"]
    },
    "gift_card_refundable": {
      "type": "noul",
      "instructions": "A gift card bought in the same order is eligible for a cash refund under the store policy."
    }
  }
}

### List the served models
GET {{host}}/v1/models

### Service health (includes the model load time)
GET {{host}}/health

### Liveness (does not depend on the model)
GET {{host}}/health/live
